{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>ולא יכלו</b> Three times in the Masorah: this one, and the other — ויחתרו האנשים להשיב אל היבשה ילא יכולו, and וירא מלך מואב כי חזק ממנו המלחמה וגו׳, להבקיע אל מלך אדום ולא יכולו. Teaches that even if they had fled to the sea because of the lice, there [the lice] would have come upon them and fought with them."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:14.980629216Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}